        "renderShape": {
          "kind": "markdown"
        },
        "markdown": "# Your first useful graph\n\nKeep one question, its evidence, and the next step together.\n\n1. [Explore the workshop example](github://twilite-zone/public/tutorial/first-graph/root.node).\n2. Bring a question or project of your own.\n3. [Build your first graph with AI](github://twilite-zone/public/tutorial/bootstrap-llm/root.node).\n\nBrowsing and trying authoring are free. Saving requires production access.\n",
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
          "state": "manually-shaped",
          "source": "manual",
          "updatedAt": 1781401873847,
          "reason": "node-drag"
        }
      }
