        "identity": {
          "graphId": "tutorial-start-here"
        },
        "markdown": "## Start with the example\n\n[Open: Which venue should we use for a workshop?](github://twilite-zone/public/tutorial/first-graph/root.node)\n\nFollow **Venue notes → Decision → Next step**. Read the labels on the lines: they explain why the pieces belong together.\n\nThen ask yourself: what would need revisiting if the venue notes changed?\n\n[Build a graph about your own question](github://twilite-zone/public/tutorial/bootstrap-llm/root.node)\n\nNeed help moving around? [Open the interface guide](github://twilite-zone/public/tutorial/interface/root.node).\n",
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
          "state": "auto-placed",
          "source": "layout",
          "updatedAt": 1781399661723,
          "reason": "auto-layout"
        }
      }
